<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-realm-in-face` params=`~ the realm's root rests inside a face root`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-house-root` params=`~ the root would hold projections/ or config/`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-workspace-unbound` params=`~ the workspace binds no directory here`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`surface-workspace-in-tree` params=`~ the workspace rests inside another git work tree`>>
```

